            "value" : "帮助语音输入正确识别产品名、人名或技术术语等词汇。这些词汇会通过 Kraki 账户在你的设备间同步，并在你听写时发送给修正服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help voice input get your names and terms right, like product names, people or tech jargon. Synced across your devices with your Kraki account and sent to the correction service when you dictate. %lld of %lld." : {
