    "Kraki for Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 版 Kraki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki for Mac %@ is available" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki for Mac %@ 已可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki for Mac runs Kraki in the background and updates it with the app. Your sign-in and sessions carry over. You'll allow Full Disk Access for Kraki once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki for Mac 在后台运行 Kraki，并随应用一起更新。你的登录状态和会话会保留。你只需为 Kraki 允许一次完全磁盘访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki for Mac uses the install you already have. You keep updating it from Terminal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki for Mac 使用你已有的安装版本。你仍需从终端更新它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kraki found" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已找到 kraki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is already set up on this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 已设置 Kraki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is connected. To start a session, this Mac needs a coding agent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 已连接。要开始会话，这台 Mac 需要安装编程 Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is installed where only an administrator can change it. Run `kraki update` on that computer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 的安装位置仅允许管理员修改。请在该电脑上运行 `kraki update`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is off in Login Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 已在登录项中关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is restarting on %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 正在 %@ 上重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is running from a temporary location macOS uses for downloaded apps, so it can't keep working in the background. In Finder, drag Kraki from Downloads into Applications, then open it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 正从 macOS 存放下载应用的临时位置运行，因此无法持续在后台工作。请在访达中将 Kraki 从“下载”拖到“应用程序”，然后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is running from the disk image. Drag Kraki onto the Applications folder, then open it from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 正在从磁盘映像运行。请将 Kraki 拖到“应用程序”文件夹，然后从那里打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is still online" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 仍在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki is turned off in System Settings → General → Login Items. Turn Kraki on there so your phone and other computers can use the agents on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 已在系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项中关闭。请在那里开启 Kraki，让你的手机和其他电脑可以使用这台 Mac 上的 Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki isn't running on this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上的 Kraki 未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kraki not found in PATH" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 PATH 中未找到 kraki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki now uses the agents that are ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 现已使用就绪的 Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki on this Mac could not confirm the pairing. Restart Kraki and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上的 Kraki 无法确认配对。请重启 Kraki 后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki on this Mac hasn't set up pairing yet. Update or restart Kraki, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上的 Kraki 尚未设置配对。请更新或重启 Kraki 后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki restarts on %@; about a minute." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 将在 %@ 上重启，大约需要一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki restarts on %@. This takes about a minute; running sessions are asked about first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 会在 %@ 上重新启动，大约需要一分钟；如有运行中的会话，会先询问你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki runs agents like Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot CLI or Pi. Install one, sign in to it, then click Check Again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 可以运行 Claude Code、Codex、GitHub Copilot CLI 或 Pi 等 Agent。请安装并登录其中一个，然后点按“重新检查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki runs the agents you install on this Mac, with your own accounts. Install an agent and sign in to it once in Terminal, then click Check Again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 使用你自己的账户运行这台 Mac 上安装的 Agent。请安装 Agent 并在终端中登录一次，然后点按“重新检查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki runs the coding agents installed on this Mac, so you can use them from here, your phone and your other computers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 运行这台 Mac 上安装的编程 Agent，让你可以在这里、手机和其他电脑上使用它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki sends timings like how fast messages are delivered and replies start, plus connection drops and crashes, so we can find problems and make Kraki better. Never message text, voice or attachments." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 会发送消息送达和回复开始所需的时间、连接断开和崩溃等数据，帮助我们发现问题并改进 Kraki。绝不包含消息文字、语音或附件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kraki start failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kraki start 失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki uses the agents installed and signed in on this Mac. Install or sign in to an agent in its own app or in Terminal, then click Check Again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 使用这台 Mac 上已安装并登录的 Agent。请在 Agent 自己的应用或终端中安装或登录，然后点按“重新检查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki will use the new language the next time it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 将在下次打开时使用新语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki works with the coding agents on that computer. Install one there, sign in to it, then restart Kraki on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 配合该电脑上的编程 Agent 使用。请在该电脑上安装一个并登录，然后重启 Kraki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki works with the coding agents on your computer. Install one and sign in to it, then check again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 配合电脑上的编程 Agent 使用。请安装一个并登录，然后重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kraki's servers delete your account, your devices, notification tokens, preferences, custom words and voice usage. Every phone, browser and computer is signed out.\n\nConversations are stored on your own computers, not on Kraki's servers; they stay there. To remove them too, delete them first or run `kraki` on the computer and choose \"Delete all Kraki data\".\n\nSigning in with GitHub again later creates a new, empty account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 的服务器会删除你的账户、设备、通知令牌、偏好设置、自定义词汇和语音用量。所有手机、浏览器和电脑都将退出登录。\n\n对话存储在你自己的电脑上，而非 Kraki 的服务器上，因此会保留在原处。如需一并移除，请先删除对话，或在电脑上运行 `kraki` 并选择“Delete all Kraki data”。\n\n之后再次使用 GitHub 登录会创建一个新的空账户。"
          }
