            "value" : "正在发送…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends the conversation title, agent and model, and names or terms that appear in recent messages, to the third-party correction service so names you are discussing are spelled right. Whole messages and anything that looks like a key, token, password or file path are never sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将对话标题、Agent、模型以及近期消息中的姓名或术语发送给第三方修正服务，以正确拼写你正在讨论的名称。绝不会发送完整消息，以及任何疑似密钥、令牌、密码或文件路径的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends the current message" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送当前消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends timings such as how long messages take to deliver and replies to start, connection drops, voice errors and crashes, so we can find problems and make Kraki better. Never message text, drafts, voice, attachments or file names. Turning this off stops performance uploads and deletes unsent performance data. Basic daily account activity counts are separate." : {
      "comment" : "Release-only (KRAKI_DIAG) settings; not seen by Debug extraction",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送消息送达和回复开始所需的时间、连接断开、语音错误和崩溃等数据，帮助我们发现问题并改进 Kraki。绝不包含消息文字、草稿、语音、附件或文件名。关闭后将停止上传性能数据，并删除尚未发送的性能数据。基本的每日账户活动计数不受此设置影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
