    },
    "The code is copied and GitHub is open in your browser. Paste it there and approve Kraki." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "验证码已复制，GitHub 已在浏览器中打开。请在那里粘贴验证码并授权 Kraki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code was already used or has expired. Run `kraki connect` on the computer and scan the new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "二维码已使用或已过期。请在电脑上运行 `kraki connect` 并扫描新二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command-line version of Kraki%@ already runs your agents in the background. You only need one of them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "命令行版 Kraki%@ 已在后台运行你的 Agent。你只需使用其中一个版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer didn't confirm the change. Check that it's online, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电脑未确认此更改。请确认电脑在线后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer is offline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电脑已离线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GitHub code expired. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub 验证码已过期，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The kraki CLI on this Mac stays usable for commands like `kraki status` and `kraki logs`; Kraki keeps running the background service." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上的 kraki CLI 仍可用于运行 `kraki status` 和 `kraki logs` 等命令；Kraki 会继续运行后台服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone audio session couldn't be started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法启动麦克风音频会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone stopped providing audio. Please try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "麦克风已停止提供音频。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new version didn’t start on %@, so it went back to %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The new version didn’t start on %1$@, so it went back to %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新版本未能在 %1$@ 上启动，已恢复至 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new version didn’t start on %@, so it went back to the previous version." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新版本未能在 %@ 上启动，已恢复至之前的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only coding agent on this computer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此电脑上唯一的编程 Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay did not report the computer whose code you scanned with a matching key. Messages are only encrypted to keys Kraki trusts. If this keeps happening, contact support." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中继服务器未报告与你扫码的电脑匹配的密钥。消息只会使用 Kraki 信任的密钥加密。如果问题持续出现，请联系支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay reported a new encryption key for %@. Kraki keeps using the key it trusted, so messages to that computer won't go through. If you reinstalled Kraki there, run `kraki connect` on it and scan the new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中继服务器报告了 %@ 的新加密密钥。Kraki 会继续使用原先信任的密钥，因此无法向该电脑发送消息。如果你在该电脑上重新安装了 Kraki，请运行 `kraki connect` 并扫描新二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session device is offline and no cached conversation is available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会话设备已离线，且没有可用的对话缓存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
