          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's agents are offline because Kraki is turned off in System Settings → General → Login Items. Turn it back on to reconnect them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kraki 已在“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项”中关闭，因此这台 Mac 上的 Agent 已离线。重新开启即可恢复连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes this device's saved verification keys for the computer, not your account or sessions. The encrypted connection will rely on account authorization instead of those keys. Only continue if you expected the change; reconnect the app afterward if needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作将移除此设备为该电脑保存的验证密钥，不会移除你的账户或会话。加密连接将改为依赖账户授权，而不是这些密钥。仅在此更改符合你的预期时继续；如有需要，之后重新连接应用。"
          }
        }
