      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown server error" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未知服务器错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlike your chats, which are end-to-end encrypted, voice input is processed in the cloud: your recording is sent through Kraki's voice service to a third-party speech recognition provider to turn it into text.\n\nWith Correct Transcripts on, the text, your Custom Words and some conversation context (the title, agent, model and names or terms from recent messages; never whole messages or anything that looks like a key or password) are sent to a third-party AI service that fixes mistakes.\n\nYou can turn these off in Settings → Voice Input." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与端到端加密的聊天不同，语音输入在云端处理：录音会通过 Kraki 语音服务发送给第三方语音识别服务商，转换为文字。\n\n启用“修正转写文本”后，转写文本、你的自定义词汇和部分对话上下文（标题、Agent、模型，以及近期消息中的姓名或术语；绝不包含完整消息或任何疑似密钥、密码的内容）会发送给第三方 AI 服务以修正错误。\n\n你可以在“设置”→“语音输入”中关闭这些选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取消置顶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
