          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While this Mac is online, your phone and other computers can use its agents, even with the Kraki window closed. Quitting Kraki takes it offline; opening Kraki brings it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 在线时，即使关闭 Kraki 窗口，你的手机和其他电脑也能使用它的 Agent。退出 Kraki 会使其离线，打开 Kraki 后会重新上线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will update when the running sessions finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行中的会话结束后将更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, macOS keeps asking for permission whenever an agent touches Desktop, Documents or other protected folders. Turn on “Kraki” once in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有此权限，Agent 每次访问桌面、文稿或其他受保护的文件夹时，macOS 都会请求授权。请在系统设置中开启“Kraki”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
